---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Footer     from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Yeremie | Youvngprcuts · Dublin, OH"
  description="The story behind Yeremie Mijon — barber, Dublin OH. Started in his garage, now running his own private loft at Salon Lofts Sawmill."
>

<header class="nav">
  <div class="nav-inner">
    <a href="/" class="logo">
      <div class="logo-main">YOUVNGPRCUTS<em>.</em></div>
      <div class="logo-sub">Yeremie Mijon · Dublin, OH</div>
    </a>
    <a href="/" class="nav-back">← Back to Home</a>
  </div>
</header>

<section class="page-head">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="ph-eyebrow he he1">
      <div class="ph-line"></div>
      <span class="ph-tag">The Story</span>
    </div>
    <h1 class="page-h he he2">
      FROM THE<br/>
      <span class="str">GARAGE</span><br/>
      TO THE LOFT.
    </h1>
    <p class="page-lead he he3">
      How it started, how it's going, and what you can expect every time you sit down.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<main class="article">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="article-inner">

      <div class="block reveal">
        <div class="block-label">The Beginning</div>
        <h2 class="block-h">Started in<br/>My Garage.</h2>
        <p class="block-p">
          I started cutting in my garage back in 2020. Just me, my clippers, and whoever trusted me enough to sit down. From there I worked at a few barbershops around Columbus, learned a lot, and picked up even more along the way.
        </p>
        <p class="block-p">
          Eventually I got the courage to go out on my own. Now I got Suite 13 at Salon Lofts Sawmill in Dublin. My own private space, my own standards. And a full barbershop is coming soon too so stay tuned for that.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="hr reveal"></div>

      <div class="block reveal">
        <div class="block-label">What Every Visit Looks Like</div>
        <h2 class="block-h">No Rush.<br/>No Shortcuts.</h2>
        <p class="block-p">
          Every client gets the same thing. We talk before I start so I know exactly what you want. Then I get to work and I don't stop until it looks right. Doesn't matter how long it takes.
        </p>
        <div class="pull">
          <p class="pull-text">"I don't let you walk out looking anything less than what you came in for."</p>
        </div>
        <p class="block-p">
          You came in with something in mind. You're leaving with exactly that. I check the blend, I check the symmetry, I check the finish. We're not done until we're both looking at it like yeah, that's it.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="hr reveal"></div>

      <div class="block reveal">
        <div class="block-label">The Space</div>
        <h2 class="block-h">Private Loft.<br/>Just Us.</h2>
        <p class="block-p">
          Suite 13 at Salon Lofts Sawmill in Dublin. No waiting room, no other clients in your space, no distractions. Just a clean focused setup where I can do my best work on every single cut.
        </p>
        <p class="block-p">
          Free parking out front. Easy to find. And a full barbershop is in the works so keep an eye out for that.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="hr reveal"></div>

      <div class="block reveal">
        <div class="block-label">Services</div>
        <h2 class="block-h">What I Do.</h2>
        <div class="svc-grid">
          <div class="svc-item">
            <div class="svc-name">VIP Package</div>
            <div class="svc-note">No beard · 1 hr 30 mins · $100</div>
          </div>
          <div class="svc-item">
            <div class="svc-name">VIP Package with Beard</div>
            <div class="svc-note">1 hr 30 mins · $120</div>
          </div>
          <div class="svc-item">
            <div class="svc-name">Haircut</div>
            <div class="svc-note">45 mins · $40</div>
          </div>
          <div class="svc-item">
            <div class="svc-name">Beard</div>
            <div class="svc-note">15 mins · $20</div>
          </div>
          <div class="svc-item">
            <div class="svc-name">Eyebrows</div>
            <div class="svc-note">15 mins · $10</div>
          </div>
          <div class="svc-item">
            <div class="svc-name">Lineup</div>
            <div class="svc-note">30 mins · $30</div>
          </div>
          <div class="svc-item">
            <div class="svc-name">Goatee</div>
            <div class="svc-note">15 mins · $5</div>
          </div>
          <div class="svc-item">
            <div class="svc-name">Design</div>
            <div class="svc-note">15 mins · $15</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="hr reveal"></div>

      <div class="block reveal">
        <div class="block-label">What to Expect</div>
        <h2 class="block-h">Every Time<br/>You Sit Down.</h2>
        <ul class="checklist">
          <li><strong>We always talk before I start</strong> so I know exactly what you want</li>
          <li><strong>The fade is cut for your face</strong> not whoever sat down before you</li>
          <li><strong>I keep going until it looks right</strong> no rushing to the next person</li>
          <li><strong>Private loft, just us</strong> no waiting room, no noise, no chaos</li>
          <li><strong>Book online, show up, leave clean</strong> simple as that</li>
          <li><strong>Full barbershop coming soon</strong> stay tuned</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="hr reveal"></div>

      <div class="block reveal">
        <p class="block-p closing">
          This started in my garage and grew into something I'm proud of. Every client that sits in my chair gets the same focus and attention I gave the very first one. That part hasn't changed and it won't.
        </p>
        <p class="about-sig">— <strong>Yeremie Mijon</strong></p>
      </div>

      <div class="cta-block reveal">
        <h2 class="cta-h">Ready to Book?</h2>
        <p class="cta-sub">
          Mon, Wed through Sat 10am to 7pm · Sun 11am to 4pm · Closed Tuesdays<br/>
          Salon Lofts Sawmill, Suite 13 · Dublin, OH
        </p>
        <div class="cta-btns">
          <a href="https://youvngprcuts.setmore.com/yeremie" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-red">Book an Appointment</a>
          <a href="/#contact" class="btn btn-line">Send a Message</a>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</main>

<Footer />

</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .nav-back { font-family: var(--fm); font-size: .68rem; letter-spacing: .14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--dim); transition: color .15s; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: .4rem; }
  .nav-back:hover { color: var(--text); }

  .page-head { padding: 5rem 0 3.5rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); position: relative; overflow: hidden; max-width: 780px; margin: 0 auto; padding-left: 1.75rem; padding-right: 1.75rem; }
  .page-head::before { content: ''; position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; bottom: 0; width: 2px; background: var(--red); }
  .ph-eyebrow { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: .75rem; margin-bottom: 1.25rem; }
  .ph-line { width: 36px; height: 1px; background: var(--red); flex-shrink: 0; }
  .ph-tag { font-family: var(--fm); font-size: .68rem; letter-spacing: .14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--red); }
  .page-h { font-family: var(--fd); font-size: clamp(3.5rem,8vw,6rem); line-height: .92; letter-spacing: .02em; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 1.25rem; }
  .page-h .str { -webkit-text-stroke: 1.5px var(--text); color: transparent; }
  .page-lead { font-size: 1.05rem; color: var(--dim); line-height: 1.7; max-width: 36rem; }

  .article { padding: 4rem 0; }
  .article .wrap { max-width: 780px; }
  .article-inner { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 3.5rem; }
  .block-label { font-family: var(--fm); font-size: .6rem; letter-spacing: .22em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--red); margin-bottom: .85rem; }
  .block-h { font-family: var(--fd); font-size: clamp(1.8rem,3.5vw,2.8rem); line-height: .95; letter-spacing: .02em; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 1.25rem; }
  .block-p { font-size: .97rem; color: var(--dim); line-height: 1.85; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .block-p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .block-p strong { color: var(--text); font-weight: 500; }
  .block-p.closing { font-size: 1.05rem; color: var(--text); line-height: 1.8; }
  .sig { font-family: var(--fm); font-size: .75rem; letter-spacing: .1em; color: var(--text); margin-top: 1rem; }
  .about-sig { font-family: var(--fm); font-size: .75rem; letter-spacing: .1em; color: var(--text); margin-top: 1rem; }
  .sig-sub { color: var(--dim); }

  .pull { border-left: 2px solid var(--red); padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem; margin: 2.5rem 0; background: var(--bg2); }
  .pull-text { font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 300; font-style: italic; line-height: 1.55; color: var(--text); }

  .hr { height: 1px; background: var(--border); }

  .checklist { list-style: none; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: .75rem; margin-top: 1.25rem; }
  .checklist li { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: .85rem; font-size: .95rem; color: var(--dim); line-height: 1.6; }
  .checklist li::before { content: '✦'; color: var(--red); font-size: .55rem; margin-top: .35rem; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .checklist li strong { color: var(--text); font-weight: 500; }

  .svc-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 1px; border: 1px solid var(--border); margin-top: 1.25rem; overflow: hidden; }
  .svc-item { padding: 1rem 1.1rem; background: var(--bg2); }
  .svc-name { font-size: .92rem; color: var(--text); margin-bottom: .2rem; }
  .svc-note { font-family: var(--fm); font-size: .6rem; letter-spacing: .1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--dim); }

  .cta-block { background: var(--bg2); border: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 2.5rem; text-align: center; position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
  .cta-block::before { content: ''; position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; height: 2px; background: var(--red); }
  .cta-h { font-family: var(--fd); font-size: clamp(2rem,4vw,3rem); letter-spacing: .04em; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: .75rem; }
  .cta-sub { font-size: .9rem; color: var(--dim); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
  .cta-btns { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .75rem; justify-content: center; }

  .reveal { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px); transition: opacity .6s ease, transform .6s ease; }
  .reveal.in { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }

  @keyframes fadeUp { from { opacity:0; transform: translateY(18px); } to { opacity:1; transform: translateY(0); } }
  .he { opacity: 0; animation: fadeUp .65s ease forwards; }
  .he1 { animation-delay: .05s; } .he2 { animation-delay: .2s; } .he3 { animation-delay: .35s; }
</style>

<script>
  const io = new IntersectionObserver(
    (entries) => entries.forEach(e => {
      if (e.isIntersecting) { e.target.classList.add('in'); io.unobserve(e.target); }
    }),
    { threshold: 0.1 }
  );
  document.querySelectorAll('.reveal').forEach(el => io.observe(el));
</script>